"description":"Estimara is the AI-powered rehab cost estimator built for real estate investors. Stop guessing on repair costs and start making more confident offers on every deal.\n\nSNAP & ANALYZE\nTake photos or upload videos of any property and get instant AI-powered rehab estimates in minutes. Our AI identifies repair items, calculates costs based on your local market, and gives you a detailed breakdown by room. Perfect for house flipping, wholesaling, and buy & hold investing.\n\nKNOW YOUR NUMBERS\n\nBudget and retail rehab cost estimates\nAfter Repair Value (ARV) calculator\nMaximum Allowable Offer (MAO) calculator\nAssignment fee tracking for wholesalers\nFix & flip profit calculator\nBuy & hold rental analysis\nReal estate deal analyzer\nDEAL PIPELINE\nTrack every wholesale deal or fix and flip project from analysis to close. Move deals through Analyzing, Offer Made, Under Contract, Closed, and more.\n\nCONTRACTOR BID ANALYZER\nUpload any contractor quote and our AI instantly tells you if you're being overcharged, what each line item should cost, and exactly what to negotiate to get a fair price.\n\nSHARE & EXPORT\nGenerate professional Scope of Work reports, share deal analyses with your team, and create shareable links for any property.\n\nPerfect for wholesalers, house flippers, fix and flip investors, landlords, and real estate agents.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "minimumOsVersion":"16.6", "bundleId":"com.despia.estimara", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "releaseDate":"2026-03-30T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":6}]
